{
  "info": {
    "name": "Prematrícula — API v1: registro, revisiones y constancias",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Backend Laravel/Sanctum. Sin credenciales ni tokens incluidos. Configura base_url (incluye /api/v1), identifier y password. Ejecuta Login como coordinador para modificar/importar. En Validar y Confirmar selecciona exactamente el mismo archivo. Consulta docs/curriculum.md para límites, errores y política de protección histórica. Ambos cargos coordinadores tienen los mismos permisos. Períodos, ventanas e historial: docs/academic-process.md. Fechas de ventana locales en zona institucional; reapertura siempre global. Las notas no determinan aprobación por umbral. Flujo definitivo: BORRADOR -> ENVIADA sin aprobación individual. Ver docs/student.md. La corrección mantiene la revisión vigente y crea un borrador; el reenvío exitoso emite otra constancia."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "identifier",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "sha256",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "catalog_fingerprint",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "course_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "period_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "pre_enrollment_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "import_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "history_sha256",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "history_fingerprint",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "detail_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "revision_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/login",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{identifier}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Correo institucional o código universitario como string. Configura las variables identifier/password; no guardes secretos en una colección compartida."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.unset('token');",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const payload = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', payload.data.token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Login correcto', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Usuario actual",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/me"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout (revocar token actual)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/logout"
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.unset('token'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catálogo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar catálogo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/courses?per_page=20"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar curso por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/courses/{{course_id}}"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Modificar datos académicos (curso no utilizado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/coordinator/courses/{{course_id}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"horas_teoria\": \"2.50\",\n  \"prerrequisitos\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Solo coordinadores. Prerrequisitos reemplaza la lista completa. Cursos utilizados en historial o prematrícula solo permiten cambios de estado. No renombrar codigo."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Cambiar estado (también para curso utilizado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/coordinator/courses/{{course_id}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"estado\": \"INACTIVO\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Malla curricular XLSX — coordinadores",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Descargar plantilla XLSX",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/coordinator/curriculum/template"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Validar archivo (sin persistencia)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/coordinator/curriculum/validate",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": null
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Selecciona un .xlsx. Revisa el informe. Solo si la validación es válida se guardan SHA-256 y huella base para confirmar."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.unset('sha256');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.unset('catalog_fingerprint');",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const report = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "    if (report.valid) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('sha256', report.sha256);",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('catalog_fingerprint', report.catalog_fingerprint);",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirmar importación",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/coordinator/curriculum/import",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": null
                },
                {
                  "key": "sha256",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "{{sha256}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "catalog_fingerprint",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "{{catalog_fingerprint}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Selecciona el mismo archivo validado. Hashes guardados automáticamente por Validar. Se revalida bajo bloqueo y se persiste todo o nada. 409: vuelve a validar; 422: corrige datos. Reenvío idéntico no duplica registros."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Exportar malla XLSX",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/coordinator/curriculum/export",
            "description": "Usa Send and Download. Incluye cursos activos e inactivos, ocho columnas sin estado; conserva códigos de texto y horas fraccionarias."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
